«
  @ ------------------------------------------------------------
  @  TriAsymPDF
  @  Density (or mass) at X.
  @  Author & design          : Jean Wilson
  @  Co-authors & programming  : Claude & Claude Code (Anthropic)
  @  Arguments may be given loose or bundled in a list of 4; that list is
  @  what LastArguments reports, and its length is checked before use.
  @ ------------------------------------------------------------
  IF DUP TypeName "list" == THEN IF DUP Size 4 ≠ THEN "TriAsymPDF: needs 4 arguments" DoError END Explode Drop END
  → Xminv Xmaxv xpv Xv « Xminv 0 + Xmaxv 0 + xpv 0 + Xv 0 + → Xmin Xmax xp X « 'IFTE(X<Xmin;0;IFTE(X≤xp;2*(X-Xmin)/((Xmax-Xmin)*(xp-Xmin));IFTE(X≤Xmax;2*(Xmax-X)/((Xmax-Xmin)*(Xmax-xp));0)))' →Num Xminv Xmaxv xpv Xv 4 →List Drop » »
»
